he char  that almost not quite burnt but  blackened deliciousness really allows me  to taste the full spectrum of flavor  from the sweetness of the tomato to the  dairy of the cheese the high point of  the basil and then the fundamental  warmth of the wheat in the crust that is  what pizza should be  Oh  you
 

